        {
          "_name": "features06",
          "_sourceTheme": "servicem5",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"features06 servicem5\" group=\"Features\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Secondary BG\" value=\"#ffe66d\" name=\"title\" condition=\"showTitle\" selected>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\">\n        <header>Cards</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Title\" name=\"showCardTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Text\" name=\"showCardText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Cards Border\" value=\"#050f0f\" name=\"border\" selected>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/servicem5/components/_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ebffe5\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/servicem5/components/_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#f7fff7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-12\">\n                <div class=\"content-wrapper\" mbr-class=\"{'flex-row-reverse' : reverseContent}\">\n                    <div class=\"content-wrap\">\n                        <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                            <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title, .icon-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>Мы специализируемся&nbsp;</b><b><span><b>в следующих областях:</b></span></b></h2>\n                            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\"></p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"items-wrapper\">\n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"item features-without-image active\">\n                            <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                                <div class=\"card-box\">\n                                    <h4 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">- Задерж</h4>\n                                    <p class=\"item-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-text\"><b>-&nbsp;Задержка речи</b><br><br><b>-&nbsp;Общее</b> <b>недоразвитие речи (ОНР)</b> - комплексное расстройство, затрагивающее различные аспекты речи, включая произношение, грамматику, словарный запас и понимание.&nbsp;<br><br><b>-</b> Различные <b>нарушения в произношении звуков</b> и звукосочетаний, приводящих к трудностям в понимании и практическом использовании речи.<br><br><b>-</b>&nbsp;<b>Сигматизм</b> – дефект звукопроизношения, при котором есть проблемы с артикуляцией шипящих и свистящих звуков.<br><br><b>- Заикание</b> - речевое нарушение, характеризующееся повторением звуков, слогов или слов, что может приводить к затруднениям в плавности и ритме речи.<br><br><b>-</b> <b>Мутизм</b> - нежелание ребенка общаться и отвечать на вопросы.<br><br>- <b>Расстройство социальной коммуникации</b> - трудности с речью в социальной обстановке.&nbsp;<br><br><b>- Расстройство речи при аутизме, синдроме Дауна, дефиците интеллекта, дефиците внимания, синдроме Туретта, и тд.</b><br><br><b>- Расстройство речи при различных нарушениях слуха.</b><br></p>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            ".content-wrapper": {
              "padding": "0 60px",
              "display": "flex",
              "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                "display": "block",
                "padding": "0"
              },
              ".content-wrap": {
                "width": "50%",
                "padding-right": "80px",
                "@media (max-width: 1199px)": {
                  "padding-right": "32px"
                },
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "padding-right": "0",
                  "width": "100%",
                  "margin-bottom": "32px"
                },
                "& when (@reverseContent)": {
                  "padding-right": "0",
                  "padding-left": "80px",
                  "@media (max-width: 1199px)": {
                    "padding-left": "32px"
                  },
                  "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                    "padding-left": "0"
                  }
                },
                ".text-wrapper": {
                  "position": "sticky",
                  "top": "32px",
                  "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                    "position": "static"
                  },
                  ".mbr-section-title": {
                    "position": "relative",
                    "z-index": "1",
                    "margin-bottom": "32px",
                    "span": {
                      "padding": "0 10px",
                      "border-radius": "8rem",
                      "background-color": "@title"
                    },
                    "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                      "margin-bottom": "24px"
                    }
                  },
                  ".mbr-text": {
                    "position": "relative",
                    "z-index": "1",
                    "margin-bottom": "0"
                  }
                }
              },
              ".items-wrapper": {
                "padding-left": "80px",
                "border-left": "3px solid @border",
                "width": "50%",
                "@media (max-width: 1199px)": {
                  "padding-left": "32px"
                },
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "border-left": "none",
                  "border-top": "3px solid @border",
                  "padding-left": "0",
                  "width": "100%"
                },
                "& when (@reverseContent)": {
                  "padding-left": "0",
                  "padding-right": "80px",
                  "border-left": "none",
                  "border-right": "3px solid @border",
                  "@media (max-width: 1199px)": {
                    "padding-right": "32px"
                  },
                  "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                    "padding-left": "0",
                    "border-right": "none",
                    "border-top": "3px solid @border"
                  }
                },
                ".item": {
                  "padding": "32px 0",
                  "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                    "padding": "32px 0 0"
                  },
                  ".item-wrapper": {
                    ".card-box": {
                      ".item-title": {
                        "margin-bottom": "16px"
                      },
                      ".item-text": {
                        "margin-bottom": "16px",
                        "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                          "margin-bottom": "0"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#050f0f"
            },
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#050f0f"
            },
            ".item-title": {
              "color": "#050f0f"
            },
            ".item-text": {
              "color": "#050f0f"
            }
          },
          "_cid": "ul9zukTuO1",
          "_anchor": "features06-5",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            "h3": {
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "font-weight": "300"
            },
            ".mbr-content-text": {},
            ".card": {
              "word-wrap": "break-word"
            },
            ".mbr-iconfont": {
              "font-size": "80px",
              "color": "#149dcc"
            },
            ".count1": {
              "color": "#fff",
              "font-weight": "900"
            },
            ".mbr-content-title": {
              "color": "#fff"
            },
            ".svg-1": {
              "position": "absolute",
              "bottom": "0"
            },
            ".svg-1 path": {
              "fill": "@LineColor"
            },
            ".svg-2": {
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0"
            },
            ".svg-2 path": {
              "fill": "@LineColor"
            },
            ".container-fluid": {
              "max-width": "1200px"
            },
            "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 2px)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 2px)"
            },
            "@media (min-width: 767px)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 15px)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 15px)"
            }
          },
          "_name": "counters1",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"counters1 counters\" group=\"Counters\" plugins=\"ViewportChecker\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"15\" step=\"1\" value=\"10\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"15\" step=\"1\" value=\"11\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Block Title\" name=\"showTitles\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Icons\" name=\"showIcons\">\n        <header>Additional</header>\n        <select title=\"Cards Count\" name=\"cardsAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\" selected>4</option>\n        </select>\n        <!-- <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card Bg\" name=\"cardBg\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"!transparentBg\"> -->\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@THEME_PATH@/components/_images/children.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffa45b\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/201169087\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Line\" name=\"LineColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" checked condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <svg class=\"svg-2\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1428 94.61\"><g id=\"Layer_3\" data-name=\"Layer 3\"><path class=\"cls-1\" d=\"M-83,10\" transform=\"translate(83 33)\"></path><path class=\"cls-2\" d=\"M986.33,46.5s132.5-37,318,0C1304.33,46.5,1200.83,80.5,986.33,46.5Z\" transform=\"translate(83 33)\"></path></g><g id=\"Layer_4\" data-name=\"Layer 4\"><path class=\"cls-2\" d=\"M-83,10S127,65.11,394,30.06,986.33,46.5,986.33,46.5,1218,83,1345,38V-33H-83Z\" transform=\"translate(83 33)\"></path></g></svg>\n    <div class=\"container-fluid\">\n        <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title pb-4 align-center mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n            Counters\n        </h2>\n        <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle pb-5 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n            Mobirise is a beautiful site constructor\n        </h3>\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                <div class=\"card p-3 align-center col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-3': cardsAmount == '4','col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3'}\">\n                    <div class=\"panel-item\" mbr-class=\"{'p-3':!transparentBg}\">\n                        <div class=\"card-img pb-3\" mbr-if=\"showIcons\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"mbri-mobirise mbr-iconfont\"></span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"card-text\">\n                            <h3 class=\"count count1 pt-3  mbr-regular mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-app-selector=\".card-img, .count\">4</h3>\n                            <h4 class=\"mbr-content-title mbr-bold mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitles\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-content-title\">Специалиста</h4>\n                            <p class=\"mbr-content-text pt-2 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-content-text\">\n                                Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, conse ctetuer adipiscing elit.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"card p-3 align-center col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount>1\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-3': cardsAmount == '4','col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3'}\">\n                    <div class=\"panel-item\" mbr-class=\"{'p-3':!transparentBg}\">\n                        <div class=\"card-img pb-3\" mbr-if=\"showIcons\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"mbri-touch-swipe mbr-iconfont\"></span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"card-text\">\n                            <h3 class=\"count count1 pt-3 mbr-regular mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-app-selector=\".card-img, .count\">78</h3>\n                            <h4 class=\"mbr-content-title mbr-bold mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitles\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-content-title\">Совместных лет опыта</h4>\n                            <p class=\"mbr-content-text pt-2 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-content-text\">\n                                Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, conse ctetuer adipiscing elit.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"card p-3 align-center col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount>2\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-3': cardsAmount == '4','col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3'}\">\n                    <div class=\"panel-item\" mbr-class=\"{'p-3':!transparentBg}\">\n                        <div class=\"card-img pb-3\" mbr-if=\"showIcons\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"mbri-responsive mbr-iconfont\"></span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"card-text\">\n                            <h3 class=\"count count1 pt-3 mbr-regular mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-app-selector=\".card-img, .count\">7</h3>\n                            <h4 class=\"mbr-content-title mbr-bold mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitles\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-content-title\">Возрастных групп</h4>\n                            <p class=\"mbr-content-text pt-2 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-content-text\">\n                                Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, conse ctetuer adipiscing elit.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n\n                <div class=\"card p-3 align-center col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount>3\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-3': cardsAmount == '4','col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3'}\">\n                    <div class=\"panel-item\" mbr-class=\"{'p-3':!transparentBg}\">\n                        <div class=\"card-img pb-3\" mbr-if=\"showIcons\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"mbri-hot-cup mbr-iconfont\"></span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"card-texts\">\n                            <h3 class=\"count count1 pt-3 mbr-regular mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-app-selector=\".card-img, .count\">386</h3>\n                            <h4 class=\"mbr-content-title mbr-bold mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitles\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-content-title\">Поставленных звуков Р-р-р</h4>\n                            <p class=\"mbr-content-text pt-2 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-content-text\">\n                                Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, conse ctetuer adipiscing elit.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n        </div>\n        \n    </div>\n    <svg class=\"svg-1\" id=\"curve\" data-name=\"Layer 2\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1428 130.87\"><path class=\"cls-1\" d=\"M-83,345V288s158-27,262-22l104,5,138,8,300,21s245,4,281-5c0,0-9-39,33-45,0,0,8-51,58-25,0,0,48-36,61,23,0,0,27,2,28,24,0,0,163-22,163-17v90Z\" transform=\"translate(83 -214.13)\"></path></svg>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "rGu4IJ222A",
          "_anchor": "counters1-e",
          "_sourceTheme": "kidsm4",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 15px)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 15px)",
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".carousel-item": {
              "margin-top": "1.3rem",
              "justify-content": "center",
              "& > div": {
                "width": "100%"
              }
            },
            ".carousel-item.active, .carousel-item-next, .carousel-item-prev": {
              "display": "flex"
            },
            ".carousel-controls": {
              "a": {
                "transition": "opacity .5s",
                "font-size": "1.2rem",
                "span": {
                  "padding": "15px",
                  "border-radius": "50%",
                  "opacity": ".9"
                },
                "&:hover": {
                  "span": {
                    "opacity": "1"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            ".signature, .desk": {
              "margin": "0"
            },
            ".mbr-text": {
              "border-radius": "30px",
              "color": "#ffffff",
              "position": "relative",
              "padding": "2rem"
            },
            ".mbr-text1": {
              "background-color": "@warningColor"
            },
            ".mbr-text2": {
              "background-color": "@secondaryColor"
            },
            ".mbr-text3": {
              "background-color": "@primaryColor"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "margin-top": "2rem",
              "margin-bottom": "0",
              "color": "#70747f"
            },
            ".img-block": {
              "display": "flex",
              "justify-content": "center",
              "margin-top": "2rem",
              "align-items": "center"
            },
            "img": {
              "width": "80px",
              "height": "80px",
              "border-radius": "50%",
              "margin": "0"
            },
            ".title-block": {
              "margin-left": "1rem"
            },
            ".signature": {
              "font-weight": "900",
              "color": "#12265a"
            },
            ".quote_svg": {
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "calc(100% - 4px)",
              "width": "30px",
              "left": "40px"
            },
            ".quote_svg1": {
              "fill": "@warningColor"
            },
            ".quote_svg2": {
              "fill": "@secondaryColor"
            },
            ".quote_svg3": {
              "fill": "@primaryColor"
            },
            ".mbr-text::after": {
              "content": "'“'",
              "display": "inline-block",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "-1rem",
              "left": "1rem",
              "font-size": "15rem",
              "line-height": "1",
              "color": "rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.23)"
            },
            ".carousel-indicators li": {
              "background-color": "@ColorCircle",
              "width": "10px",
              "height": "10px",
              "border": "none",
              "border-radius": "50%"
            },
            ".carousel-indicators": {
              "position": "absolute",
              "margin-top": "2rem",
              "bottom": "0rem"
            },
            "ol": {
              "margin-bottom": "0"
            },
            ".carousel": {
              "display": "flex",
              "overflow": "hidden",
              "padding-bottom": "3rem"
            },
            "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 5px)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 5px)",
              ".container-fluid": {
                "padding": "0 1rem"
              },
              ".col-md-4": {
                "padding": "0"
              },
              ".mbr-text": {
                "padding": "1rem"
              }
            },
            ".container-fluid": {
              "padding": "0 1rem",
              "max-width": "1200px"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            }
          },
          "_name": "testimonials1",
          "_sourceTheme": "kidsm4",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"carousel slide testimonials-slider testimonials1 kidsm4_testimonials1\" group=\"Additional Blocks\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"BootstrapCarouselSwipe,mbr-testimonials-slider\" data-interval=\"false\">\n\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"15\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"15\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n\t\t<header>Show/Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n\t\t<header>Card</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Name\" name=\"showName\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showDesk\" checked>\n\t\t<select name=\"columns\" title=\"Columns\">\n\t\t\t<option value=\"1\">1</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"2\">2</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"3\" selected>3</option>\n\t\t</select>\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Carousel\" name=\"carouselItems\" min=\"1\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Indicators\" name=\"ColorCircle\" value=\"#45b3df\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Autoplay\" name=\"showAutoplay\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Autoplay Interval (ms)\" name=\"interval\" min=\"1000\" max=\"8000\" step=\"1000\" value=\"5000\" condition=\"showAutoplay\">\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/children.jpg\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/201169087\">\n\t\t</fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/children.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay&&bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay&&bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n\n\n\t<div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay&&bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n\n\t<div class=\"container-fluid\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-section-title align-center\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"line-bg-warning\">Отзывы</span></h2>\n\t\t<h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\"></h3>\n\t\t<div class=\"carousel slide\" role=\"listbox\" data-pause=\"true\" data-keyboard=\"false\" data-ride=\"{{showAutoplay ? 'carousel' : 'false'}}\" data-interval=\"{{showAutoplay ? interval : 'false'}}\" mbr-class=\"{'pt-4':showTitle || showSubtitle}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"carousel-indicators\">\n\t\t\t\t<li data-slide-to=\"0\" data-bs-slide-to=\"0\" class=\"active\"></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li mbr-if=\"carouselItems> 1\" data-slide-to=\"1\" data-bs-slide-to=\"1\"></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li mbr-if=\"carouselItems> 2\" data-slide-to=\"2\" data-bs-slide-to=\"2\"></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li mbr-if=\"carouselItems> 3\" data-slide-to=\"3\" data-bs-slide-to=\"3\"></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li mbr-if=\"carouselItems> 4\" data-slide-to=\"4\" data-bs-slide-to=\"4\"></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li mbr-if=\"carouselItems> 5\" data-slide-to=\"5\" data-bs-slide-to=\"5\"></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li mbr-if=\"carouselItems> 6\" data-slide-to=\"6\" data-bs-slide-to=\"6\"></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li mbr-if=\"carouselItems> 7\" data-slide-to=\"7\" data-bs-slide-to=\"7\"></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li mbr-if=\"carouselItems> 8\" data-slide-to=\"8\" data-bs-slide-to=\"8\"></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li mbr-if=\"carouselItems> 9\" data-slide-to=\"9\" data-bs-slide-to=\"9\"></li>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div mbr-list mbr-list-grow=\"carouselItems\" class=\"carousel-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"carousel-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-4\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-text mbr-text1 mbr-fonts-style align-left\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-article data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline>Нашему семилетнему сыну требовалась серьезная помощь в коррекции речи,\n<svg class=\"quote_svg quote_svg1\" viewBox=\"0 0 259.43 367.5\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<path d=\"M.53,0H255.84c15,14-23.29,233.58.07,367.5C255.91,367.5-13.49,272.51.53,0Z\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</path>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</svg><div>и мы очень рады, что обратились именно к Марии.&nbsp; ...</div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/oksana.webp\" alt>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title-block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"mbr-fonts-style signature mbr-bold\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showName\" data-app-selector=\".signature\">Оксана Арбатова</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"desk mbr-fonts-style align-left\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showDesk\" data-app-selector=\".desk\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tмама Тима</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-4\" mbr-if=\"columns>1\" mbr-class=\"{'d-none d-md-block': columns>1}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-text mbr-text2 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-article data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline>Мария спасибо за ваш сервис! После занятий с вами, навыки Алисы заметно улучшились! Благодаря вашему профессионализму ...</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/ulyana-160x160.jpg\" alt>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title-block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"mbr-fonts-style signature mbr-bold\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showName\" data-app-selector=\".signature\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tУльяна Евдокимова</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"desk mbr-fonts-style align-left\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showDesk\" data-app-selector=\".desk\">мама Алисы</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-4\" mbr-if=\"columns>2\" mbr-class=\"{'d-none d-md-block': columns>2}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-text mbr-text3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-article data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline>Спасибо всем родителям которые помогают нам помочь детям !<svg class=\"quote_svg quote_svg3\" viewBox=\"0 0 259.43 367.5\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<path d=\"M.53,0H255.84c15,14-23.29,233.58.07,367.5C255.91,367.5-13.49,272.51.53,0Z\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</path>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</svg></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/screenshot%202024-07-18%20105329-160x146.png\" alt>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title-block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"mbr-fonts-style signature mbr-bold\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showName\" data-app-selector=\".signature\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tБарбариска</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"desk mbr-fonts-style align-left\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showDesk\" data-app-selector=\".desk\">&nbsp;</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"carousel-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-4\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-text mbr-text1 mbr-fonts-style align-left\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-article data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline>Нашему семилетнему сыну требовалась серьезная помощь в коррекции речи,\n<div>и мы очень рады, что обратились именно к Марии. Проблем было много, но\n</div><div>благодаря профессиональному подходу, терпению и вниманию специалиста,\n</div><div>мы заметили значительные улучшения достаточно быстро. Занятия проходят\n</div><div>в дружелюбной и поддерживающей атмосфере, что помогает нашему сыну\n</div><div>чувствовать себя уверенно и с удовольствием заниматься.</div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/oksana.webp\" alt>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title-block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"mbr-fonts-style signature mbr-bold\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showName\" data-app-selector=\".signature\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tОксана Арбатова</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"desk mbr-fonts-style align-left\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showDesk\" data-app-selector=\".desk\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tмама Тима</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-4\" mbr-if=\"columns>1\" mbr-class=\"{'d-none d-md-block': columns>1}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-text mbr-text2 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-article data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline>Мария спасибо за ваш сервис! После занятий с вами, навыки Алисы заметно улучшились! Благодаря вашему профессионализму и индивидуальному подходу, у ребенка не только появился речевой прогресс, а так же уверенность в себе!</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/ulyana-160x160.jpg\" alt>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title-block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"mbr-fonts-style signature mbr-bold\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showName\" data-app-selector=\".signature\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tУльяна Евдокимова</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"desk mbr-fonts-style align-left\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showDesk\" data-app-selector=\".desk\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tмама Алисы</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-4\" mbr-if=\"columns>2\" mbr-class=\"{'d-none d-md-block': columns>2}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-text mbr-text3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-article data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline>Спасибо всем родителям которые помогают нам помочь детям !&nbsp;<svg class=\"quote_svg quote_svg3\" viewBox=\"0 0 259.43 367.5\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<path d=\"M.53,0H255.84c15,14-23.29,233.58.07,367.5C255.91,367.5-13.49,272.51.53,0Z\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</path>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</svg></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/screenshot%202024-07-18%20105329-160x146.png\" alt>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title-block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"mbr-fonts-style signature mbr-bold\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showName\" data-app-selector=\".signature\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tБарбариска</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"desk mbr-fonts-style align-left\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showDesk\" data-app-selector=\".desk\"></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
