        {
          "_name": "features06",
          "_sourceTheme": "servicem5",
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            ".content-wrapper": {
              "padding": "0 60px",
              "display": "flex",
              "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                "display": "block",
                "padding": "0"
              },
              ".content-wrap": {
                "width": "50%",
                "padding-right": "80px",
                "@media (max-width: 1199px)": {
                  "padding-right": "32px"
                },
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "padding-right": "0",
                  "width": "100%",
                  "margin-bottom": "32px"
                },
                "& when (@reverseContent)": {
                  "padding-right": "0",
                  "padding-left": "80px",
                  "@media (max-width: 1199px)": {
                    "padding-left": "32px"
                  },
                  "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                    "padding-left": "0"
                  }
                },
                ".text-wrapper": {
                  "position": "sticky",
                  "top": "32px",
                  "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                    "position": "static"
                  },
                  ".mbr-section-title": {
                    "position": "relative",
                    "z-index": "1",
                    "margin-bottom": "32px",
                    "span": {
                      "padding": "0 10px",
                      "border-radius": "8rem",
                      "background-color": "@title"
                    },
                    "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                      "margin-bottom": "24px"
                    }
                  },
                  ".mbr-text": {
                    "position": "relative",
                    "z-index": "1",
                    "margin-bottom": "0"
                  }
                }
              },
              ".items-wrapper": {
                "padding-left": "80px",
                "border-left": "3px solid @border",
                "width": "50%",
                "@media (max-width: 1199px)": {
                  "padding-left": "32px"
                },
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "border-left": "none",
                  "border-top": "3px solid @border",
                  "padding-left": "0",
                  "width": "100%"
                },
                "& when (@reverseContent)": {
                  "padding-left": "0",
                  "padding-right": "80px",
                  "border-left": "none",
                  "border-right": "3px solid @border",
                  "@media (max-width: 1199px)": {
                    "padding-right": "32px"
                  },
                  "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                    "padding-left": "0",
                    "border-right": "none",
                    "border-top": "3px solid @border"
                  }
                },
                ".item": {
                  "padding": "32px 0",
                  "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                    "padding": "32px 0 0"
                  },
                  ".item-wrapper": {
                    ".card-box": {
                      ".item-title": {
                        "margin-bottom": "16px"
                      },
                      ".item-text": {
                        "margin-bottom": "16px",
                        "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                          "margin-bottom": "0"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#050f0f"
            },
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#050f0f"
            },
            ".item-title": {
              "color": "#050f0f"
            },
            ".item-text": {
              "color": "#050f0f"
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"features06 servicem5\" group=\"Features\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked=\"\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline=\"\" title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline=\"\" title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked=\"\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Secondary BG\" value=\"#ffe66d\" name=\"title\" condition=\"showTitle\" selected=\"\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\">\n        <header>Cards</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Title\" name=\"showCardTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Text\" name=\"showCardText\" checked=\"\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Cards Border\" value=\"#050f0f\" name=\"border\" selected=\"\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax=\"\">\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ebffe5\" selected=\"\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#f7fff7\" condition=\"overlay &amp;&amp; bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline=\"\" title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay &amp;&amp; bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay &amp;&amp; bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-12\">\n                <div class=\"content-wrapper\" mbr-class=\"{'flex-row-reverse' : reverseContent}\">\n                    <div class=\"content-wrap\">\n                        <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                            <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title, .icon-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>Nous sommes spécialisés dans&nbsp;</b><b><span><b>les domaines suivants :</b></span></b></h2>\n                            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\"></p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"items-wrapper\">\n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"item features-without-image active\">\n                            <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                                <div class=\"card-box\">\n                                    <h4 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">- Задерж</h4>\n                                    <p class=\"item-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-text\"><b>Le retard du lanagage</b>.\n<br>\n<br><b>    Le trouble développemental du langage</b> est un trouble complexe qui affecte divers aspects de la parole, notamment la prononciation, la grammaire, le vocabulaire et la compréhension. \t\n<br>\n<br><b>    Le trouble des sons de la parole</b> est une appellation large qui regroupe des troubles de communication dans lesquels l’intelligibilité de la parole est atteinte : l’enfant se fait difficilement comprendre par les gens de son entourage en raison de ses erreurs de production de sons.\n<br>\n<br><b>    Le sigmatisme</b> est un défaut de prononciation de certains sons comme s, ch, z. \n<br>\n<br><b>    Le bégaiement</b> est un trouble de la parole caractérisé par la répétition de sons, de syllabes ou de mots, ce qui peut entraîner des difficultés au niveau de la fluidité et du rythme de la parole. \t\n<br>\n<br><b>    Le mutisme sélectif</b> est un trouble de la communication caractérisé par un refus ou une incapacité à parler dans un contexte social précis (ex: l'enfant parle à la maison, mais refuse de parler dans le contexte scolaire). \n<br>\n<br><b>    Le trouble de la communication sociale</b> signifie des difficultés spécifiquement avec la pragmatique, c'est-à-dire l'utilisation de la communication.\n<br>\n<br><b>    Troubles du langage associés à d'autres diagnostics</b> (l'autisme, le syndrome de Down, la déficience intellectuelle, le trouble déficitaire de l'attention, le syndrome de Gilles de la Tourette, etc.).<br></p>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "features06-34",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "uu1o50ols8",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
